# Optional single-variable SMTP fallback for hosts that do not save multiple env vars.
# Format: host=smtp.hostinger.com;port=465;user=info@example.com;pass=password;from=info@example.com;to=info@example.com
# If the host panel forces the key back to SMTP_HOST, the same value can be stored there.
